the runtime bundled for linux-aarch64-musl is statically linked and cannot load a shared object
package  artifact
esqlite  esqlite/priv/esqlite3_nif.so
fix: [tools.ginary.target."linux-aarch64-musl"] otp_variant = "dynamic", or build for a gnu target; --allow-native-mismatch does not lift this one, because a static emulator has no dynamic loader to call
